  "description": "Whether it's BMX or cruising the streets, Chad is about that Bike Life! Riding around town, throwing wheelies, listening to music and laughing with your friends, that is all CK! We worked with Chad to come up with a bike that he would be hyped on for ride-outs and every day rolling. The B.M.F. is all of that, with luxury-inspired graphics, paint that pops, and fitted with BMX components to hold up to everything Chad (and you) can dish out. The BMX is Chad Kerley, the B.M.F. is Bike Life.\n6061-T6 heat-treated alloy frame. Integrated head tube, mid BB shell. V-brake mounts\n1 1/8\" Threadless full chromoly fork w/internally threaded steerer tube. Tapered legs\nHaro Baseline 3-pc chromoly. 8-spline 175mm\nPoly platform. chromoly 9/16\" axle\nHaro B.M.F. chromoly 4-piece bars\n36 hole double wall rims\nHaro B.M.F railed seat\nHaro B.M.F pad set\nPremium CK grips",
